  lore:
  - id: freelance/0/0
    title: Maintenance testimony
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Open Secrets
    text: A Helix technician has hidden repair manuals inside routine compliance backups. The official service program charges a year's wages for the same instructions.
  - id: freelance/0/1
    title: An unofficial record
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Open Secrets
    text: An abandoned Helix test site still transmits weather readings. Local growers use the open feed to protect their crops. An engineer keeps renewing the relay budget.
  - id: freelance/0/2
    title: What the archive kept
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Open Secrets
    text: Helix's discarded patent register credits a community workshop with the original design. The attribution survived in the archive after it disappeared from the product page.
